4a: power ON/OFF menu now picks API/account first (+ separate renter group),
then lists that API's servers (paginated), mirroring the Delete-VPS flow.

4c: Install RDP offers a source choice — (1) manual VPS credentials or
(2) own cloud API token (DO/Linode/AWS/UpCloud) auto-create+install, reusing
the non-gated renter_rdp_* chain via startOpenApiRdp/promptOpenApiAdd.
